&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;getting-started-development&#34;&gt;Getting Started (Development)
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;For more information on setting up your development environment, contributing, and working with Jenkins internals, check the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;contributing guide&lt;/a&gt; and the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/doc/developer/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Jenkins Developer Documentation&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;source&#34;&gt;Source
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our latest and greatest source of Jenkins can be found on &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jenkinsci/jenkins&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt;. Fork us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;contributing-to-jenkins&#34;&gt;Contributing to Jenkins
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;New to open source or Jenkins? Here’s how to get started:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Read the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;CONTRIBUTING.md&#34; &gt;Contribution Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Check our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/jenkinsci/jenkins/issues?q=is%3Aissue%20is%3Aopen%20label%3A%22good%20first%20issue%22&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;good first issues&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://matrix.to/#/#jenkinsci_newcomer-contributors:gitter.im&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Gitter chat&lt;/a&gt; for questions and help&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information about participating in the community and contributing to the Jenkins project,
see &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/participate/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;this page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Documentation for Jenkins core maintainers is in the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;docs/MAINTAINERS.adoc&#34; &gt;maintainers guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;news-and-website&#34;&gt;News and Website
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;All information about Jenkins can be found on our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;official website&lt;/a&gt;, including documentation, blog posts, plugin listings, community updates, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stay up-to-date with the latest Jenkins news, tutorials, and release notes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/blog/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Jenkins Blog&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/doc/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Documentation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://plugins.jenkins.io/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Plugins Index&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/events/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Events&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Follow Jenkins on social media to stay connected with the community:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://x.com/jenkinsci&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Twitter / X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/@jenkinscicd&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.linkedin.com/company/jenkins-project/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;governance&#34;&gt;Governance
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Jenkins project is governed by an open source community.
To learn more about the governance structure, project leadership, and how decisions are made, visit the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/project/governance/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Governance Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;adopters&#34;&gt;Adopters
&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Jenkins is trusted by &lt;strong&gt;millions of users&lt;/strong&gt; and adopted by &lt;strong&gt;thousands of companies&lt;/strong&gt; around the world — from startups to enterprises — to automate their software delivery pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore the &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/project/adopters/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Adopters Page&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://stories.jenkins.io&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;https://stories.jenkins.io&lt;/a&gt; to see:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Companies and organizations using Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Success stories and case studies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;How Jenkins is used in different industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If your company uses Jenkins and you&amp;rsquo;d like to be featured, feel free to &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://www.jenkins.io/project/adopters/contributing/#share-your-story&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;submit your story&lt;/a&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
